    "detailed_description": "A Zone is a leisure game of black and white painting style<br />\r\nThis is a horizontal and oblique elimination type game<br />\r\nCooperate to find the elements of the game<br />\r\nAt the same time, you get 100 points each time<br />\r\nUnlock a  stubble game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI'm a depressed person.<br />\r\nThe pressure of working and living every day makes me gasp for breath.<br />\r\nBut I really want to be happy.<br />\r\nI also like making games.<br />\r\nMy abilities are limited.<br />\r\nOne day scribbled on paper about what I wanted to do.<br />\r\nA sudden idea flashed through my mind.<br />\r\nI want to bring you a simple and discovery-based game.<br />\r\nI hope this graffiti-type game can bring happiness to everyone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you are tired, let go of your boredom.<br />\r\nMaybe this little game won't bring you anything.<br />\r\nBut I want world peace.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI hope you can support my creation.<br />\r\nI really hope I can continue to make all kinds of games for you.~<br />\r\nI love you! I hope everyone can be happy!<br />\r\nAt least not as depressed as I am.<br />\r\nI want people who love me, too.<br />\r\nI also want to experience the feeling of being loved.",
    "about_the_game": "A Zone is a leisure game of black and white painting style<br />\r\nThis is a horizontal and oblique elimination type game<br />\r\nCooperate to find the elements of the game<br />\r\nAt the same time, you get 100 points each time<br />\r\nUnlock a  stubble game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI'm a depressed person.<br />\r\nThe pressure of working and living every day makes me gasp for breath.<br />\r\nBut I really want to be happy.<br />\r\nI also like making games.<br />\r\nMy abilities are limited.<br />\r\nOne day scribbled on paper about what I wanted to do.<br />\r\nA sudden idea flashed through my mind.<br />\r\nI want to bring you a simple and discovery-based game.<br />\r\nI hope this graffiti-type game can bring happiness to everyone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you are tired, let go of your boredom.<br />\r\nMaybe this little game won't bring you anything.<br />\r\nBut I want world peace.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI hope you can support my creation.<br />\r\nI really hope I can continue to make all kinds of games for you.~<br />\r\nI love you! I hope everyone can be happy!<br />\r\nAt least not as depressed as I am.<br />\r\nI want people who love me, too.<br />\r\nI also want to experience the feeling of being loved.",
